WEBVTT

00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:13.960
<i>When you asked me how I felt about you</i>

00:00:14.210 --> 00:00:20.300
<i>I said, "You're okay, I guess."</i>

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:25.040
<i>Wait, are you crying?</i>

00:00:25.180 --> 00:00:26.340
<i>Oh!</i>

00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:30.500
<i>Now I think you might be cute.</i>

00:00:31.020 --> 00:00:37.000
<i>Then you tried to run away 
so I grabbed your hand.</i>

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:42.790
<i>And something deep within 
my heart began to dance.</i>

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:48.990
<i>I wish there were a textbook for romance.</i>

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:55.100
<i>There are just too many 
problems I don't understand.</i>

00:00:55.320 --> 00:01:01.240
<i>I wish there were a teacher for romance.</i>

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:03.520
<i>If I add You + Me</i>

00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:08.000
<i>Will the answer be "Love"?</i>

00:01:17.640 --> 00:01:19.940
I’ve always been big for my age.

00:01:19.940 --> 00:01:22.880
Whenever we’d line up by height 
in class, I was always dead last.

00:01:23.440 --> 00:01:25.760
And ironically, my surname is 
“Koizumi” (“Little Spring”)

00:01:25.760 --> 00:01:29.050
Sorry it’s not “Oizumi” 
(“Big Spring”)

00:01:29.660 --> 00:01:30.970
…Story of my life.

00:01:32.200 --> 00:01:36.940
And so, we’ll be entering 
Summer Vacation tomorrow.

00:01:36.940 --> 00:01:41.060
Everyone, please take care of your health.

00:01:41.060 --> 00:01:46.930
This is a very crucial time for you 
First and Second Years to grow, so...

00:01:46.930 --> 00:01:50.940
It is my sincere hope that 
you all use this time wisely.

00:01:51.820 --> 00:01:54.890
You First and Second Years, 
for example, have sports cam--

00:01:55.120 --> 00:01:56.140
Oh, crap!

00:01:56.140 --> 00:01:58.730
All the beasts I’ve summoned 
have been destroyed!!

00:02:10.680 --> 00:02:11.520
Idiot.

00:02:11.880 --> 00:02:16.720
First High School Summer! I’ll 
Get A Boyfriend If It Kills Me!

00:02:14.530 --> 00:02:16.340
…You stayed up all night 
playing video games?

00:02:17.060 --> 00:02:18.000
Sorry.

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:19.160
How very effeminate.

00:02:19.160 --> 00:02:19.980
Ohohoho.

00:02:19.980 --> 00:02:22.410
But falling asleep standing 
up – are you a giraffe?

00:02:22.410 --> 00:02:24.000
Maybe in a past life.

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:24.890
You’re a funny girl.

00:02:24.890 --> 00:02:28.100
Okay, as punishment for being funny, you 
get to come to school starting tomorrow.

00:02:28.100 --> 00:02:30.090
- You lie! Tomorrow is Summer Vaca—

00:02:29.620 --> 00:02:30.600
- Not for you.

00:02:31.120 --> 00:02:34.140
You’re going to spend the 
summer studying and learning.

00:02:34.140 --> 00:02:35.100
Ehhhh?

00:02:35.100 --> 00:02:37.040
Don’t “ehhhh?” me.
That’s all. Go home.

00:02:38.820 --> 00:02:41.940
Being tall doesn’t seem to have any perks.

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:43.880
Unless you call “standing 
out at all times” a perk.

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:50.290
Here ya go.

00:02:50.690 --> 00:02:51.600
Are you mocking me?

00:02:51.600 --> 00:02:52.280
Yep.

00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:54.200
I hear you’re doing well 
in the Basketball Team?

00:02:54.200 --> 00:02:55.780
Good boy, little-Kotani. 
(“Little Ravine”)

00:02:55.780 --> 00:02:58.160
It’s OTANI (“Big Ravine”), you moron.

00:02:58.160 --> 00:02:59.960
Move it, giantess.

00:02:59.960 --> 00:03:00.770
Mr. Nakano?

00:03:00.770 --> 00:03:01.490
Ohhh, thanks.

00:03:01.490 --> 00:03:04.200
I just did you a favor and you 
call me “giantess” as thanks?!

00:03:04.610 --> 00:03:06.380
Would you rather I call you “Goliath”?

00:03:06.380 --> 00:03:07.560
Shut up, little runt.

00:03:07.560 --> 00:03:08.690
Ohhh, you wanna fight?

00:03:08.690 --> 00:03:09.400
What if I do!

00:03:09.400 --> 00:03:11.100
Easy there, All Hanshin Kyojin.

00:03:11.100 --> 00:03:12.650
Who’ya talkin’ to!

00:03:12.650 --> 00:03:14.970
And stop callin’ us that!

00:03:16.600 --> 00:03:18.340
The “All Hanshin Kyojin.”

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:21.980
Mr. Nakano gave us this nickname 
the first day of school.

00:03:22.520 --> 00:03:25.770
Do I have any volunteers 
to be my class aides?

00:03:25.770 --> 00:03:27.490
Hey, All Hanshin Kyojin over there.

00:03:28.080 --> 00:03:30.460
Koizumi, Otani, why don’t 
you give it a try?

00:03:32.530 --> 00:03:33.760
Yesssss?

00:03:33.760 --> 00:03:34.780
Thanks, folks!

00:03:34.780 --> 00:03:35.810
Why the hell!

00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:38.100
What the hell! Move it, giantess!

00:03:38.100 --> 00:03:39.830
Stand aside, little runt!

00:03:39.830 --> 00:03:42.050
Now, now, let’s keep the 
lovers’ quarrels for home.

00:03:42.050 --> 00:03:43.130
We’re not lovers!!

00:03:46.500 --> 00:03:55.180
Automatic Service Corner

00:03:47.400 --> 00:03:49.650
Summer school is such a drag.

00:03:49.650 --> 00:03:53.140
Nobuko, that’s what you 
get for failing midterms.

00:03:53.920 --> 00:03:58.080
Well, Darling will be at school for 
basketball practice so it works out fine.

00:03:58.080 --> 00:04:00.450
Nakao, right? Thanks for rubbing it in

00:04:00.450 --> 00:04:03.020
If only I had a boyfriend…

00:04:03.020 --> 00:04:04.970
No, at the very least, someone I liked.

00:04:04.970 --> 00:04:06.520
Then I’d be much more 
inspired to work hard.

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:09.770
What surprises me even more is 
Chiharu’s strange whims and fancies.

00:04:09.770 --> 00:04:11.360
Who VOLUNTARILY attends summer school?

00:04:11.360 --> 00:04:14.920
I guess the brains of top 
students work differently.

00:04:16.800 --> 00:04:19.680
…I just don’t wanna 
be the only one left out.

00:04:19.960 --> 00:04:21.970
Just kidding, we know ya love us.

00:04:22.730 --> 00:04:26.100
Hey, summer school means we get to 
mix with kids from the other classes.

00:04:26.100 --> 00:04:27.940
I wonder if we’ll meet any hot guys?

00:04:27.940 --> 00:04:31.880
Just the thought of Otani not 
being there is heaven to me.

00:04:31.880 --> 00:04:34.290
I don’t like meeting new boys…

00:04:36.970 --> 00:04:38.090
Why are YOU here?

00:04:38.090 --> 00:04:39.970
That’s what I wanna ask!

00:04:40.620 --> 00:04:42.930
I see…I should’ve known.

00:04:42.930 --> 00:04:44.960
I’d forgotten that Otani was also stupid.

00:04:44.960 --> 00:04:46.020
Look who’s talking!

00:04:46.020 --> 00:04:48.820
I was called in here for 
SNORING, not being stupid!

00:04:48.820 --> 00:04:49.930
You think that makes you better than me?

00:04:49.930 --> 00:04:51.270
At least I didn’t flunk.

00:04:51.270 --> 00:04:53.160
I think snoring is more 
embarrassing than flunking!

00:04:53.160 --> 00:04:56.540
All Hanshin Kyojin, you plan to spend your 
summer entertaining us with your comedy act?

00:04:56.540 --> 00:04:59.400
For the last time, STOP calling us that!

00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:01.200
Nobuko, can we trade seats?

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:02.400
Nobuko…

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:03.580
Darling…

00:05:03.580 --> 00:05:04.920
Oh, fine.

00:05:05.370 --> 00:05:07.290
I d-don’t want to sit near a boy…

00:05:07.290 --> 00:05:09.790
Fine, it’s okay. I understand.

00:05:10.620 --> 00:05:15.960
This…THIS SUCKS!!

00:05:16.850 --> 00:05:19.000
This is the worst summer vacation ever!

00:05:19.760 --> 00:05:21.700
I wonder if we’ll meet any hot guys?

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:25.850
Excuse me, sorry I’m late.

00:05:25.850 --> 00:05:27.260
Ah, Suzuki.

00:05:27.260 --> 00:05:29.600
I haven’t taken roll yet, so you’re safe.

00:05:29.600 --> 00:05:30.510
I’ll start with Class-1!

00:05:30.850 --> 00:05:31.480
Abe

00:05:31.480 --> 00:05:31.880
Here

00:05:32.060 --> 00:05:32.740
Iida

00:05:32.740 --> 00:05:33.410
Here

00:05:33.410 --> 00:05:34.010
Ueno

00:05:34.010 --> 00:05:34.620
Here

00:05:34.620 --> 00:05:35.280
Endo

00:05:35.280 --> 00:05:35.890
Here

00:05:35.890 --> 00:05:36.540
Omachi

00:05:36.540 --> 00:05:37.500
Here

00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:44.660
Hey, may I sit behind you?

00:05:44.660 --> 00:05:48.020
S-s-sure! I would be honored!

00:05:48.020 --> 00:05:50.780
If ya sit behind Koizumi, good 
luck seeing the chalkboard.

00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:52.530
Shut your face, Otani!!

00:05:52.530 --> 00:05:55.180
Please excuse me for being so tall…

00:05:56.040 --> 00:05:58.800
Don’t worry, it’s no 
problem. I can see fine.

00:06:05.650 --> 00:06:06.760
Heartthrob!

00:06:07.140 --> 00:06:11.080
This just might turn out to be 
the BEST summer vacation ever!

00:06:24.360 --> 00:06:26.100
Oh, yes!

00:06:26.100 --> 00:06:27.440
What’s wrong with Risa?

00:06:27.440 --> 00:06:28.010
Not sure.

00:06:28.010 --> 00:06:29.370
Hey there, babe.

00:06:30.330 --> 00:06:31.960
We’ve gotta talk.

00:06:31.960 --> 00:06:34.080
Lemme borrow ya on the way home.

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:35.400
What’re you, a runt gangster?

00:06:35.400 --> 00:06:36.280
You shut up!

00:06:36.280 --> 00:06:39.220
Why do I have to be near 
you AFTER school too?

00:06:39.220 --> 00:06:41.900
What I have to say is SO important 
that we can’t talk here.

00:06:41.900 --> 00:06:44.480
What a creeper – what is it?

00:06:44.480 --> 00:06:45.150
Just wondering…

00:06:45.650 --> 00:06:47.220
Is Suzuki your type?

00:06:48.880 --> 00:06:51.240
Wh-wh-wh-why do you ask?!

00:06:51.240 --> 00:06:53.520
You’re easy to read!

00:06:53.520 --> 00:06:55.530
How did you know?

00:06:55.530 --> 00:06:57.360
It’s written all over your face.

00:06:57.360 --> 00:06:59.700
Suzuki: love at first sight.

00:06:57.560 --> 00:06:59.940
You’re not gonna blackmail me, are ya?

00:06:59.940 --> 00:07:00.850
I would never!

00:07:01.180 --> 00:07:03.170
I’m way too nice for that.

00:07:03.860 --> 00:07:09.770
I was just thinking maybe I could become 
friends with Suzuki then put in a good word for you.

00:07:09.770 --> 00:07:11.160
You really think that?!

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:12.200
Yes, I do.

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:13.180
- You lie!!

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:13.810
- Not lying.

00:07:13.810 --> 00:07:15.000
Awesome!

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:18.250
Woah, Otani, were you actually 
a really nice guy all along?

00:07:18.250 --> 00:07:19.520
Took ya that long to notice?

00:07:19.520 --> 00:07:22.360
And here I was thinking we were
 a giraffe and hunter in a past life

00:07:22.360 --> 00:07:24.480
and that you were a horrible guy…

00:07:24.480 --> 00:07:25.480
Who said anything about a giraffe?

00:07:25.480 --> 00:07:27.160
Let’s put that aside.

00:07:27.570 --> 00:07:30.250
Well then, let me treat 
you to whatever you want!

00:07:30.250 --> 00:07:32.080
A giant burger? A fish sandwich?

00:07:32.080 --> 00:07:33.180
A Crunchy-Munchy Meal?

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:34.040
Crunchy-Munchy Meal!

00:07:34.040 --> 00:07:34.780
You’ve got it!

00:07:34.780 --> 00:07:35.520
Plus…

00:07:36.330 --> 00:07:37.120
Plus?

00:07:37.120 --> 00:07:37.840
Plus…

00:07:38.760 --> 00:07:40.020
I want Tanaka.

00:07:40.770 --> 00:07:42.160
Chiharu Tanaka.

00:07:46.090 --> 00:07:48.880
I never thought Chiharu would be your type.

00:07:48.880 --> 00:07:51.000
Are you stupid? She’s freaking adorable!

00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:53.720
I have to admit even I 
think she’s adorable…

00:07:54.210 --> 00:07:57.480
And I guess little birds 
need to flock together?

00:07:57.480 --> 00:07:58.570
Drop it.

00:07:58.570 --> 00:08:00.560
Then I have some grave news for you.

00:08:00.560 --> 00:08:01.490
What?

00:08:01.490 --> 00:08:03.230
Chiharu dislikes boys.

00:08:04.140 --> 00:08:04.860
Seriously?

00:08:04.860 --> 00:08:06.690
Tried and true.

00:08:06.690 --> 00:08:08.270
Adorable!!

00:08:08.960 --> 00:08:10.620
Who cares if she dislikes boys?

00:08:10.620 --> 00:08:12.320
I’ll cure her of her perversion!

00:08:12.320 --> 00:08:14.010
…I’d like to see you try.

00:08:14.010 --> 00:08:15.810
All right! Now I’m all fired up!

00:08:15.810 --> 00:08:17.240
Good luck, man.

00:08:17.560 --> 00:08:21.540
Um, excuse me, sir, but shadow boxing 
is prohibited in this restaurant.

00:08:23.320 --> 00:08:24.480
The pool?

00:08:24.480 --> 00:08:25.370
Yep.

00:08:25.370 --> 00:08:27.370
Nakaochi and I will be there too.

00:08:27.370 --> 00:08:28.860
I can hardly wait.

00:08:28.860 --> 00:08:29.950
And also…

00:08:30.220 --> 00:08:34.080
I’m bringing a friend 
along – is that okay?

00:08:34.430 --> 00:08:39.100
Suzuki, dear… wanna be friends?

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:47.340
It’s a pool!

00:08:47.340 --> 00:08:48.560
Yep, a pool.

00:08:48.560 --> 00:08:49.730
Does it make you that happy?

00:08:49.730 --> 00:08:51.310
Freaking ecstatic!

00:08:51.310 --> 00:08:52.970
I haven’t been swimming in a year!

00:08:52.970 --> 00:08:54.510
Me neither, me neither!

00:08:54.810 --> 00:08:55.920
Splash!

00:08:57.610 --> 00:08:58.800
Take that, take that!

00:08:58.800 --> 00:09:01.320
I’m in heaven!

00:09:01.320 --> 00:09:03.260
This is the best!

00:09:03.260 --> 00:09:06.170
Much better than the pools at school!

00:09:08.500 --> 00:09:09.460
Moron!

00:09:09.460 --> 00:09:10.660
Now’s no time to be carrying on!

00:09:10.660 --> 00:09:12.160
Same goes for you!

00:09:12.160 --> 00:09:12.920
Oh, crap…

00:09:13.500 --> 00:09:15.470
In the thrill of the moment 
I lost sight of our goal.

00:09:15.820 --> 00:09:20.040
Suzuki? Hey, wanna swim over there?

00:09:20.040 --> 00:09:21.130
Sure.

00:09:21.130 --> 00:09:23.820
I’m sorry, did you not wanna swim?

00:09:23.820 --> 00:09:25.300
I wouldn’t’ve come 
if I didn’t wanna swim.

00:09:25.300 --> 00:09:25.890
Really?

00:09:25.890 --> 00:09:28.080
It’s fun watching you guys too.

00:09:28.080 --> 00:09:29.520
“Fun”?

00:09:29.520 --> 00:09:33.360
Suzuki, are you in summer school 
for failing the midterm?

00:09:33.360 --> 00:09:36.440
No, I missed the test because I was sick.

00:09:36.440 --> 00:09:38.090
Oh, that’s too bad.

00:09:44.060 --> 00:09:45.680
What am I doing?

00:09:45.680 --> 00:09:47.660
Hurry…I need to think of something to say!

00:09:47.660 --> 00:09:50.700
But I can’t think of anything to say!

00:09:51.680 --> 00:09:52.780
Hiiiii!

00:09:52.780 --> 00:09:53.680
Koizumi?

00:09:53.680 --> 00:09:54.760
Are ya having fun?

00:09:54.760 --> 00:09:57.460
Let’s all play with the beach ball!

00:09:57.460 --> 00:10:00.380
Oooootaaaaaniiiiii

00:10:00.810 --> 00:10:02.250
What the hell are ya doing?

00:10:02.250 --> 00:10:04.570
Is standing still in the water 
doing nothing really that amusing?

00:10:04.570 --> 00:10:07.300
Well, I can’t think of what to talk about!

00:10:07.300 --> 00:10:09.620
Serves ya right for trying to 
impress him by playing coy.

00:10:09.620 --> 00:10:10.390
Whaddaya mean.

00:10:10.390 --> 00:10:11.890
That’s what I mean. THAT.

00:10:12.780 --> 00:10:14.850
Just be yourself.

00:10:15.170 --> 00:10:16.030
Act normal.

00:10:19.480 --> 00:10:21.470
- That hurt, you jerk!

00:10:19.480 --> 00:10:23.200
- Okay, let’s play!

00:10:33.410 --> 00:10:34.650
Huh?

00:10:34.900 --> 00:10:35.730
What’s wrong?

00:10:35.730 --> 00:10:38.850
Where did Nakao and Nobuko go?

00:10:39.460 --> 00:10:40.360
Hey, you’re right…

00:10:40.360 --> 00:10:43.050
I saw them run off that way just a while ago.

00:10:43.580 --> 00:10:44.930
To the Water Slider.

00:10:48.020 --> 00:10:49.050
Water…

00:10:49.050 --> 00:10:50.190
Slider…

00:10:58.340 --> 00:11:00.290
Suzuki/Tanaka, wanna go on that?

00:11:00.290 --> 00:11:02.130
I’m scared of fast rides.

00:11:02.130 --> 00:11:03.440
I’m scared too.

00:11:03.440 --> 00:11:04.240
Too bad…

00:11:12.680 --> 00:11:15.100
Would ya mind if we ran off for a bit?

00:11:15.100 --> 00:11:15.930
Sure.

00:11:15.930 --> 00:11:16.650
Go ahead.

00:11:16.650 --> 00:11:17.770
Slider!!

00:11:17.770 --> 00:11:18.690
This’ll be my first time!

00:11:18.690 --> 00:11:19.300
Me too!

00:11:19.300 --> 00:11:20.250
Where’s the entrance?

00:11:20.250 --> 00:11:21.000
That way, that way!

00:11:21.920 --> 00:11:23.810
No running along the poolside!

00:11:33.560 --> 00:11:34.420
Welcome back.

00:11:34.420 --> 00:11:35.640
Fun, wasn’t it?

00:11:35.850 --> 00:11:37.780
Fan-freaking-tastic!

00:11:39.120 --> 00:11:41.740
There we go again…

00:11:41.740 --> 00:11:43.450
Hey, where’s Suzuki?

00:11:43.450 --> 00:11:45.600
Haven’t seen him.

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:51.120
Suzuki disappeared somewhere while 
I was coming back to the group.

00:11:52.080 --> 00:11:54.680
How dare she abandon me 
to play with someone else.

00:11:54.680 --> 00:11:55.820
Screw her!

00:11:58.220 --> 00:11:59.560
Oh, he’s back.

00:12:00.610 --> 00:12:01.490
Suzuki!

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:02.740
Where were you?

00:12:02.740 --> 00:12:04.700
I got thirsty, so I went to get some drinks.

00:12:04.970 --> 00:12:06.840
I bought enough for everyone.

00:12:06.840 --> 00:12:08.360
You sure come in handy, Suzuki.

00:12:08.360 --> 00:12:09.220
Do you like this?

00:12:09.220 --> 00:12:10.660
Yeah, thanks!

00:12:11.130 --> 00:12:13.060
Tanaka, I got you something warm.

00:12:13.060 --> 00:12:13.820
For me?

00:12:13.820 --> 00:12:17.000
You seemed cold.

00:12:17.460 --> 00:12:18.450
Thank you.

00:12:19.800 --> 00:12:20.900
Chilly!

00:12:20.900 --> 00:12:23.500
Sorry, would you have 
preferred something warm?

00:12:23.500 --> 00:12:25.120
No, I’m fine.

00:12:25.660 --> 00:12:27.120
How was that ride?

00:12:27.120 --> 00:12:29.500
Awesome! It was a freaking rush!

00:12:29.500 --> 00:12:30.200
It wasn’t scary?

00:12:30.200 --> 00:12:32.080
Not at all scary!

00:12:32.080 --> 00:12:34.140
Really? Then maybe I’ll give it a try.

00:12:34.140 --> 00:12:35.270
Yay! Let’s do it!

00:12:36.260 --> 00:12:37.660
I’m talking like normal.

00:12:37.660 --> 00:12:39.340
Lookin’ good!

00:12:39.340 --> 00:12:40.760
You’re so tanned.

00:12:40.760 --> 00:12:42.610
Isn’t it crazy? I tan so easily.

00:12:44.880 --> 00:12:47.840
Looks like he really did cure 
Chiharu of her man-hate.

00:12:47.840 --> 00:12:49.880
He sure is amazing.

00:12:52.280 --> 00:12:53.180
Bye.

00:12:53.420 --> 00:12:54.400
See ya later.

00:12:54.400 --> 00:12:55.490
Bye!

00:12:56.460 --> 00:12:57.690
Is this really okay?

00:12:57.940 --> 00:12:58.840
Is what okay?

00:12:58.840 --> 00:13:02.170
I mean, it’s only because Suzuki and 
Chiharu live in the same direction.

00:13:02.170 --> 00:13:03.900
Don’t worry.

00:13:03.900 --> 00:13:07.490
Suzuki’s a good guy and Chiharu’s 
been cured of her man-hate.

00:13:07.490 --> 00:13:09.700
In fact, she’s pretty crazy about me.

00:13:09.700 --> 00:13:12.650
I know! You guys looked really good together.

00:13:12.650 --> 00:13:14.570
You guys looked good too.

00:13:17.480 --> 00:13:18.700
Thanks.

00:13:19.200 --> 00:13:20.480
I owe it to you, Otani.

00:13:20.840 --> 00:13:23.410
Yeah. Let’s get ‘em again tomorrow!

00:13:23.410 --> 00:13:26.290
Yeah. Let’s grab ahold 
of happiness together!

00:13:26.920 --> 00:13:28.900
But why do I feel this way?

00:13:28.900 --> 00:13:31.680
Why do I feel an unspeakable sense of dread?

00:13:35.180 --> 00:13:37.400
Suzuki sure is a nice person.

00:13:39.200 --> 00:13:41.120
You mean you like him?

00:13:41.120 --> 00:13:44.400
No, no, that’s not it. 
It’s not like that…

00:13:44.400 --> 00:13:45.920
He’s very nurturing.

00:13:45.920 --> 00:13:47.140
Yes, that’s what I mean.

00:13:47.140 --> 00:13:49.170
He walked me home last night.

00:13:50.360 --> 00:13:51.700
Walked you home…

00:13:51.700 --> 00:13:55.540
I always thought that boys 
were rough and scary,

00:13:55.540 --> 00:13:58.450
But Suzuki is nice – I don’t 
think I’m scared of him at all.

00:13:58.920 --> 00:14:00.420
Really…

00:14:00.420 --> 00:14:03.620
But Chiharu, I saw you and Otani looked 
really good together yesterday.

00:14:03.620 --> 00:14:05.580
Nobuko! You say good things!

00:14:05.580 --> 00:14:07.140
That’s right! Otani!

00:14:07.140 --> 00:14:09.610
Oh, Otani? Yes, he’s quite easy to talk to.

00:14:09.610 --> 00:14:10.530
Right?

00:14:10.530 --> 00:14:14.000
I probably just don’t perceive 
him as a boy since he’s so short.

00:14:14.940 --> 00:14:16.180
LAUNCH!

00:14:21.850 --> 00:14:24.310
Otani…Direct hit.

00:14:25.460 --> 00:14:29.510
Bogus! If Otani heard that, how would he—

00:14:32.420 --> 00:14:33.450
Good morning.

00:14:33.660 --> 00:14:34.770
Otani…

00:14:34.770 --> 00:14:35.390
Good morning.

00:14:35.770 --> 00:14:37.090
Good morning, Otani.

00:14:37.490 --> 00:14:42.050
Good morning, Tanaka. I 
had much fun yesterday.

00:14:42.050 --> 00:14:42.850
I heard something snap…

00:14:43.890 --> 00:14:45.760
Otani, you sure are funny.

00:14:46.240 --> 00:14:47.080
Otani?

00:14:47.080 --> 00:14:49.180
I am not Otani.

00:14:49.180 --> 00:14:50.670
I am tiny so call me “Kotani”.

00:14:50.930 --> 00:14:52.280
Pull yourself together, Otani!

00:14:52.280 --> 00:14:53.160
I am Kotani.

00:14:53.160 --> 00:14:56.770
Please tell Teacher that 
Kotani will be absent today.

00:14:57.880 --> 00:14:59.770
Ko…Kotani!!

00:14:59.770 --> 00:15:01.050
He’s OTANI.

00:15:05.530 --> 00:15:06.680
Otani…

00:15:07.810 --> 00:15:09.550
I told you, I’m Kotani.

00:15:13.810 --> 00:15:15.560
Uh, well…

00:15:16.040 --> 00:15:16.890
What is it?

00:15:16.890 --> 00:15:18.020
Are you pitying me?

00:15:18.940 --> 00:15:22.250
Hey now! I’m just worried 
about you, no need to mope…

00:15:22.250 --> 00:15:23.340
I’ve every right to mope!

00:15:23.340 --> 00:15:26.890
So she said you’re small – so 
what? You’re a man, you can take it.

00:15:26.890 --> 00:15:29.210
I believe she said that BECAUSE 
I’m small, I’m NOT a man.

00:15:32.660 --> 00:15:33.840
Moron!

00:15:34.360 --> 00:15:37.400
Tall or short, if you’ve got 
a ***, it means you’re a man!

00:15:37.400 --> 00:15:38.880
Good girls shouldn’t talk like that…

00:15:38.880 --> 00:15:39.540
Shut up!

00:15:39.540 --> 00:15:42.100
Haven’t you gotten used 
to being called tiny by now?

00:15:42.100 --> 00:15:45.200
Why’re you making such a big deal over a 
girl telling you that ONCE? You disgust me!

00:15:45.200 --> 00:15:48.080
If you spend your life moping because 
of that, no one’ll like you anyway.

00:15:48.080 --> 00:15:49.330
You SCUM!

00:15:49.960 --> 00:15:52.430
Jeez! I’m pissed!

00:15:55.780 --> 00:15:58.020
Your moron-punch really smarted.

00:16:01.200 --> 00:16:02.570
Sorry…

00:16:03.080 --> 00:16:04.220
Suzuki!

00:16:04.220 --> 00:16:04.840
Good morning.

00:16:05.450 --> 00:16:09.330
Good morning? I think 
class has already started.

00:16:09.330 --> 00:16:11.120
Yeah. I’m late.

00:16:11.120 --> 00:16:12.890
Summer mornings and I don’t get along well.

00:16:12.890 --> 00:16:14.490
Ah, I see.

00:16:15.740 --> 00:16:17.580
Though winter mornings 
aren’t that much better.

00:16:17.580 --> 00:16:19.100
Ah, I see.

00:16:19.100 --> 00:16:21.320
Thanks for yesterday. I had fun.

00:16:21.320 --> 00:16:23.890
Ah, me too, thanks.

00:16:24.860 --> 00:16:25.640
Um…

00:16:25.640 --> 00:16:26.500
What?

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:27.900
Am I scary?

00:16:29.600 --> 00:16:32.810
Tanaka seemed a bit scared yesterday.

00:16:34.010 --> 00:16:36.740
Suzuki sure is a nice person.

00:16:37.490 --> 00:16:42.540
Uhhh, she’s just shy around boys – 
I don’t think it’s your fault.

00:16:43.600 --> 00:16:45.780
I’m not very good at 
talking to girls either.

00:16:45.780 --> 00:16:47.360
You are?

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:51.820
Yeah, but… Koizumi, I find 
it easy talking to you.

00:16:55.730 --> 00:16:58.090
Probably because you’re at eye-level.

00:16:58.730 --> 00:17:01.500
You just don’t seem much like a girl to me.

00:17:02.850 --> 00:17:03.500
Yes?

00:17:03.730 --> 00:17:05.340
KABOOM!

00:17:10.330 --> 00:17:11.360
Now I get it…

00:17:11.360 --> 00:17:16.180
I see… So Tanaka doesn’t 
particularly dislike me.

00:17:16.180 --> 00:17:17.290
Yeah…

00:17:21.570 --> 00:17:23.780
D-don’t tell me you LIKE Chiharu?

00:17:23.780 --> 00:17:25.490
No. No, no, not that. Why do you say that?

00:17:25.490 --> 00:17:26.180
You’re blushing!

00:17:26.180 --> 00:17:27.380
No, I’m just hot.

00:17:27.380 --> 00:17:28.540
My, what hot weather…

00:17:28.540 --> 00:17:30.090
Well, I have to go to class.

00:17:32.210 --> 00:17:33.340
It’s not what you think.

00:17:35.450 --> 00:17:36.920
What the hell!!

00:17:36.920 --> 00:17:38.900
He TOTALLY likes her.

00:17:38.900 --> 00:17:40.880
It’s obvious he likes her.

00:17:41.480 --> 00:17:43.320
Hey! Oizumi.

00:17:43.320 --> 00:17:46.280
How can ya be moping in the hall after 
yelling at me for the same thing?

00:17:46.930 --> 00:17:49.610
Sorry, forget what I said back there.

00:17:49.610 --> 00:17:50.610
What the hell are you saying?

00:17:50.610 --> 00:17:52.520
Ya really can’t help but mope, can ya.

00:17:52.520 --> 00:17:54.290
Even if you’re used to being made fun of,

00:17:54.290 --> 00:17:57.260
it hurts extra bad when 
a guy you like says it…

00:17:57.290 --> 00:17:59.220
MORON!

00:17:59.520 --> 00:18:00.490
Hey, that hurt!

00:18:00.490 --> 00:18:01.660
Payback from earlier!

00:18:01.660 --> 00:18:02.620
- But I’m a girl—

00:18:02.180 --> 00:18:03.830
I’m not giving up on Chiharu.

00:18:04.810 --> 00:18:05.800
I’m getting back in the saddle tomorrow.

00:18:06.530 --> 00:18:07.410
Otani…

00:18:07.410 --> 00:18:10.100
If you spend your time moping over 
it, no one’ll like you anyway!

00:18:10.500 --> 00:18:11.740
That’s what my grandpa always told me.

00:18:11.740 --> 00:18:12.570
Dirty liar.

00:18:13.530 --> 00:18:15.740
I’m glad you’re around, Koizumi.

00:18:16.010 --> 00:18:19.120
If ya weren’t, I’d have 
stayed down in the dumps.

00:18:20.900 --> 00:18:21.850
Guess you’re right.

00:18:22.770 --> 00:18:24.050
I’ll get back in the saddle too!

00:18:26.720 --> 00:18:27.490
All right!

00:18:27.490 --> 00:18:28.760
Let’s do this!

00:18:29.980 --> 00:18:31.220
To our local summer festival…

00:18:31.220 --> 00:18:35.050
…I invited Suzuki and 
Otani invited Chiharu.

00:18:38.500 --> 00:18:41.380
I was a fool for trying 
to be cute in a yukata!

00:18:41.380 --> 00:18:43.860
It’s like putting a 
party dress on a giantess.

00:18:45.090 --> 00:18:46.240
Otani.

00:18:47.070 --> 00:18:49.290
I don’t see Chiharu or Suzuki yet.

00:18:49.840 --> 00:18:51.640
The train was pretty crowded too…

00:18:51.640 --> 00:18:53.780
I hope they’re not lost.

00:18:55.250 --> 00:19:00.280
Special Yakisoba

00:18:55.690 --> 00:18:56.340
What is it?

00:18:56.340 --> 00:18:57.640
I didn’t recognize you at first.

00:18:57.640 --> 00:18:59.720
Do I look weird? Creepy?

00:18:59.720 --> 00:19:00.280
Not really…

00:19:01.050 --> 00:19:02.090
You look determined.

00:19:02.810 --> 00:19:03.980
Of course I am.

00:19:03.980 --> 00:19:05.500
Sorry I’m late.

00:19:05.500 --> 00:19:06.320
Ah, there she is!

00:19:06.320 --> 00:19:09.920
Risa! Suzuki’s here too.

00:19:09.920 --> 00:19:12.060
We bumped into each other…

00:19:19.770 --> 00:19:21.210
Whoosh, whoosh…

00:19:21.800 --> 00:19:24.890
They changed their positions so we 
wouldn’t get caught in the crowd.

00:19:24.890 --> 00:19:25.960
I don’t get it.

00:19:25.960 --> 00:19:28.250
I don’t get it and I 
don’t like it either.

00:19:30.610 --> 00:19:32.800
They look really good together.

00:19:32.800 --> 00:19:35.850
Almost like a starry-eyed 
couple that just got together.

00:19:39.460 --> 00:19:40.640
Koizumi…

00:19:40.640 --> 00:19:41.570
I’m fine.

00:19:42.570 --> 00:19:44.300
I’m fine with this.

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:47.040
I’m out.

00:19:53.160 --> 00:19:53.900
I’m out too.

00:19:54.120 --> 00:19:54.850
Really?

00:19:54.850 --> 00:19:56.870
Pulling back is important in comedy.

00:19:58.020 --> 00:20:00.600
Let’s just leave them together for a while.

00:20:02.440 --> 00:20:03.350
Otani…

00:20:04.080 --> 00:20:06.320
Huh? Risa? Otani?

00:20:06.640 --> 00:20:08.170
It broke!

00:20:08.170 --> 00:20:10.160
Lemme try!

00:20:10.160 --> 00:20:11.620
Nice one!

00:20:19.300 --> 00:20:21.720
Hey, Otani, next let’s…huh?

00:20:21.720 --> 00:20:23.570
Otani? Otani?

00:20:23.570 --> 00:20:24.850
I’m right here, idiot.

00:20:24.850 --> 00:20:26.260
Woah, ya scared me.

00:20:26.260 --> 00:20:28.490
I thought maybe the crowd had 
trampled you or somethin’.

00:20:28.490 --> 00:20:29.620
You wanna fist in your mouth?

00:20:29.620 --> 00:20:30.920
Sorry.

00:20:30.920 --> 00:20:32.340
What the hell, you’re creeping me out!

00:20:32.340 --> 00:20:33.800
Totally throwing me off.

00:20:33.800 --> 00:20:35.810
Let’s go eat squid. Grilled squid!

00:20:38.960 --> 00:20:43.750
Otani may be short, but he 
definitely has masculine hands.

00:20:46.540 --> 00:20:51.480
We fight all the time, but 
we’re actually very similar.

00:20:51.480 --> 00:20:54.880
We share the same complex of height-envy.

00:20:58.300 --> 00:21:00.860
I like you. Will you go out with me?

00:21:01.260 --> 00:21:01.910
Yes.

00:21:02.850 --> 00:21:07.380
After a while, Chiharu and 
Suzuki became a couple.

00:21:08.490 --> 00:21:10.550
I’m so relieved!

00:21:10.840 --> 00:21:12.340
Glad to hear it.

00:21:12.340 --> 00:21:15.770
It looked like you might’ve had 
a chance with Chiharu, though.

00:21:15.770 --> 00:21:18.250
Didn’t look like you had 
a chance with Suzuki at all.

00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:19.560
Oh, now you’ve said it.

00:21:19.560 --> 00:21:20.560
Well, whatever.

00:21:20.560 --> 00:21:23.330
If I try, I can get a girlfriend tomorrow.

00:21:23.330 --> 00:21:26.130
Is that so? That’s a 
sight I’d like to see.

00:21:30.140 --> 00:21:31.640
Then I challenge you!

00:21:31.640 --> 00:21:34.070
Whichever of us gets a 
boyfriend/girlfriend first.

00:21:34.580 --> 00:21:36.110
If I win, what do I get?

00:21:36.380 --> 00:21:38.450
I’ll buy you your favorite game.

00:21:38.450 --> 00:21:41.250
And if I win, you’re buying 
me new basketball sneakers!

00:21:42.770 --> 00:21:44.210
Challenge accepted!

00:21:44.460 --> 00:21:46.210
I’m gonna win!

00:21:50.800 --> 00:21:58.090
<i>On the way home from school, alone 
in the park, sitting on our bench,</i>

00:21:58.090 --> 00:22:02.930
<i>I noticed you were happier than usual</i>

00:22:02.930 --> 00:22:05.370
<i>So I asked you,</i>

00:22:05.370 --> 00:22:12.650
<i>"What would you do if the world disappeared?"</i>

00:22:12.650 --> 00:22:20.780
<i>Saying nothing, you squeezed 
my arm in response.</i>

00:22:21.420 --> 00:22:26.770
<i>Please, keep looking at me.</i>

00:22:26.770 --> 00:22:34.600
<i>Our lips are too close and 
my heart won't stop pounding.</i>

00:22:36.040 --> 00:22:41.920
<i>No matter what mood you're in, 
I'll accept you for who you are.</i>

00:22:41.920 --> 00:22:50.400
<i>And if your heart ever breaks 
and tears fall down your cheeks,</i>

00:22:50.400 --> 00:22:56.520
<i>I will protect you even if it means 
turning the rest of the world against me.</i>

00:22:56.520 --> 00:22:57.840
<i>I love you</i>

00:22:57.840 --> 00:23:01.460
<i>I don't need words.</i>

00:23:01.460 --> 00:23:06.920
<i>You will be my last kiss.</i>

00:23:07.380 --> 00:23:11.620
<i>Now and forever.</i>

00:23:26.680 --> 00:23:28.580
You had a girlfriend?

00:23:28.580 --> 00:23:30.140
But you’re way too Otani-ish!

00:23:30.140 --> 00:23:31.620
Oh, please!

00:23:31.620 --> 00:23:33.040
Lovely Complex

00:23:33.040 --> 00:23:34.040
Love Com.

00:23:34.040 --> 00:23:36.890
Next episode, “Love 
Triangle With The Ex?!”

00:23:36.890 --> 00:23:38.320
Don’t miss it!

00:23:37.130 --> 00:23:40.000
“Love Triangle With The Ex?!”
